@startuml teacher create question
title Teacher Create Question — Sequence Diagram

actor Teacher <<actor>>
boundary "CreateQuestionPage" as UI <<boundary>>
control "QuestionController" as Controller <<control>>
control "QuestionService" as Service <<control>>
control "QuestionRepository" as Repository <<control>>
entity "Question" as Question <<entity>>
database "MySQL" as DB <<entity>>

Teacher -> UI: Fill question form and submit
UI -> Controller: POST /questions
Controller -> Controller: validate(request)
alt validation fails
    Controller --> UI: 422 ValidationErrors
else
    Controller -> Service: createQuestion(validRequest)
    Service -> Repository: save(questionData)
    Repository -> DB: INSERT question
    Question --> Repository: question_id
    Repository --> Service: QuestionEntity
    Service --> Controller: 201 Created {id}
    Controller --> UI: show success
end

@enduml